---
title: "One Guardrails validation"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Validation ready
  s1: Error propagates
  s2: Validation cancelled
  s3: Drex call in flight
  s4: Worker checks input
  s5: Pass returned
  s6: Cancelled while worker still checks input
  s7: Replacement ready
  s8: Replacement call in flight
  s9: Correction pending
  s10: Replacement raises
  s11: Worker checks replacement
  s12: Guardrails applies correction
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s2: caller cancels
  s0 --> s4: worker begins
  s0 --> s3: request commits and starts
  s0 --> s1: input is refused
  s3 --> s1: validator handles Drex reply
  s3 --> s2: caller cancels
  s3 --> s5: validator handles Drex reply
  s3 --> s7: validator handles Drex reply
  s4 --> s3: request commits and starts
  s4 --> s6: caller cancels
  s4 --> s1: input is refused
  s6 --> s2: request commits and starts or replacement commits and starts
  s7 --> s8: replacement commits and starts
  s8 --> s10: validator handles replacement reply
  s8 --> s2: caller cancels
  s8 --> s9: validator handles replacement reply
  s7 --> s11: worker begins replacement check
  s9 --> s12: Guardrails handles original failure
  s11 --> s8: replacement commits and starts
  s11 --> s6: caller cancels
